TEST HOOKS
==========

The following fault injectors and internal togglers exist only when the VMOD
was configured with ``--enable-test-hooks``. They exist for the regression test
suite; never expose them in a production build.

$Method BOOL .test_fail_next_key_purge_wal()

Make the next durable purge WAL append fail for regression tests.

$Method BOOL .test_fail_next_persist_prepare()

Make the next persistence preparation fail for regression tests.

$Method BOOL .test_side_initial_buckets(INT buckets)

Set the initial lazy volatile side-table bucket count for regression tests.

$Method BOOL .test_abort_next_sweep()

Abort the next purge-map sweep after certificate start for regression tests.

$Method BOOL .test_force_next_attach_slot_overflow()

Make the next volatile attachment take the side-slot overflow path for regression tests.

$Method BOOL .test_fail_next_object_segment_alloc()

Make the next combined volatile object-entry and count-sidecar segment allocation fail.

$Method BOOL .test_structural_limits()

Return true when Docker-built cachetag internal object and side-slot sizes match the supported-layout assertions.

$Method BOOL .test_side_fingerprint_bits(INT bits)

Set the volatile side-table fingerprint width for regression tests. This is accepted only before the namespace has attached an object; production uses 32 bits.

$Method BOOL .test_side_start_migration(INT buckets)

Publish a test-only volatile side-table migration to ``buckets`` buckets.

$Method INT .test_side_migrate_buckets(INT buckets)

Advance a test-only volatile side-table migration by at most ``buckets`` retiring buckets. Returns ``1`` on success and a negative errno on invariant failure.

$Method INT .test_side_migration_active()

Return ``1`` when a test-only volatile side-table migration is active.

$Method INT .test_side_table_buckets()

Return the aggregate primary plus retiring volatile side-table bucket count.

$Method BOOL .test_fail_next_side_migration_alloc()

Make the next test or emergency side-table migration allocation fail.

$Method BOOL .test_resize_low_water_ready()

Make any pending low-water resize request eligible for immediate regression-test maintenance.

$Method BOOL .test_resize_worker_drain(INT timeout_ms)

Wake resize maintenance and wait until no immediate resize work remains, or until ``timeout_ms`` expires.

$Method BOOL .test_next_fellow_attr_version(INT version)

Make the next Fellow FDO attribute use the supplied envelope version.

$Method BOOL .test_next_fellow_attr_bad_length()

Make the next Fellow FDO attribute encode an invalid total length.

$Method BOOL .test_next_fellow_attr_corruption(ENUM { record_len, fold_count, envelope_flags, envelope_reserved, record_flags, duplicate_namespace })

Make the next Fellow FDO attribute encode the selected test-only corruption.

$Method BOOL .test_next_fellow_attr_read_failure()

Make the next Fellow object-attribute visit report a test-only read failure.
